WEBVTT

00:01.660 --> 00:08.990
After getting three Princess Keys, Serena has come to Glorio City, where the Tripokalon Master Class will be held.

00:01.980 --> 00:11.820
While watching anime, make sure not to sit too close to the screen and that the room is well lit.

00:11.250 --> 00:12.600
Serena, it's here, right?

00:13.000 --> 00:13.440
Yeah!

00:14.770 --> 00:16.050
Awesome!

00:16.400 --> 00:18.240
That is a big castle.

00:21.440 --> 00:22.160
It's time...

00:22.990 --> 00:25.970
...for the Glorio Tripokalon Master Class Tournament.

00:27.860 --> 00:30.110
We'll finally stand on the stage of our dreams.

00:30.330 --> 00:30.760
Sana!

00:31.590 --> 00:33.230
This is where the Kalos Queen will be determined.

00:33.580 --> 00:34.260
Millefeui!

00:34.450 --> 00:38.350
That's what we worked so hard to get three Princess Keys for, after all.

00:38.670 --> 00:39.430
Nene!

00:39.940 --> 00:42.050
Oh, you know all of us?

00:42.460 --> 00:43.600
Of course.

00:43.900 --> 00:46.790
We stood on the same stage in the Rookie Class, after all.

00:47.340 --> 00:49.820
Rivals to the very end, eh?

00:50.330 --> 00:52.280
So you're all competing in the Master Class, huh?

00:52.750 --> 00:53.640
Of course!

00:53.640 --> 00:56.610
In that case, this promises to be an even tougher fight than I thought.

00:57.060 --> 00:58.670
Yeah, bring it on!

01:03.790 --> 01:04.480
Satoshi,

01:04.780 --> 01:07.070
surely you'll be rooting for me, right?

01:07.360 --> 01:09.750
Yeah, I'll root for all of you with all I've got!

01:10.380 --> 01:12.990
Even if Serena and I face off?

01:12.990 --> 01:13.730
Hey!

01:13.730 --> 01:14.380
What do you think?

01:14.840 --> 01:16.040
In that case,

01:16.040 --> 01:17.760
I'll root for Serena with all I've got!

01:19.020 --> 01:19.970
Uh-huh...

01:20.590 --> 01:21.970
Have you made a little bit of progress?

01:22.960 --> 01:24.850
Geez! That's none of your business!

01:25.460 --> 01:25.930
What's going on?

01:27.230 --> 01:28.780
This seems somewhat complicated.

01:29.060 --> 01:29.940
Well, it is.

01:31.210 --> 01:34.110
Anyway, let's all fight with full power tomorrow!

01:34.740 --> 01:36.760
Of course! I won't lose!

01:37.160 --> 01:40.050
The same goes for that <i>other</i> competition, right?

01:38.680 --> 01:40.610
The moment has finally arrived.

01:42.560 --> 01:47.580
You shall witness the historic moment I, Musavie,

01:47.580 --> 01:49.050
reign as Kalos Queen!

01:49.050 --> 01:50.660
Yeah, Kalos Queen!

01:50.660 --> 01:51.940
Number one in the world!

01:53.330 --> 01:54.700
I know!

01:56.190 --> 01:59.920
Phew... We're lucky Musashi's mood is at its best.

01:59.920 --> 02:01.790
It's too early to let our guard down.

02:02.060 --> 02:04.770
Anyway, we have to support Musashi with everything we've got!

02:04.770 --> 02:05.140
Yeah.

02:10.350 --> 02:16.040
The Master Class Begins!
A Maidens' Fight Where Sparks Fly!!

02:18.440 --> 02:19.770
It'll finally start tomorrow, huh?

02:20.140 --> 02:20.500
Yeah!

02:20.890 --> 02:22.340
I'll come watch you first thing in the morning!

02:22.980 --> 02:24.370
That's embarrassing.

02:23.960 --> 02:33.890
Play a board game via the Pocket Monsters XY& data broadcast!
Press the d-button on your remote and try reaching the battles and the presents!!

02:23.960 --> 02:33.890
Z

02:24.370 --> 02:26.050
It's fine; you don't need to come all the way here.

02:26.470 --> 02:27.830
What are you talking about?

02:28.150 --> 02:30.180
There's no way I'm <i>not</i> gonna go watch my daughter's big moment.

02:30.770 --> 02:32.610
I'm worried I might mess up.

02:33.160 --> 02:34.770
I guess I am a little nervous after all...

02:35.240 --> 02:38.650
Even I still get nervous before a race.

02:39.090 --> 02:39.810
<i>You</i> do, Mama?

02:40.360 --> 02:42.360
That's when I tell myself,

02:42.720 --> 02:44.190
"Go for broke!"

02:47.400 --> 02:48.700
Hey, Mama...

02:50.300 --> 02:50.860
I...

02:51.980 --> 02:55.280
At first I left because I didn't want to practice Sihorn Racing,

02:57.600 --> 02:59.670
but now I'm really glad I went on a journey.

03:00.230 --> 03:04.090
I met friends and Pokémon that support me.

03:04.570 --> 03:05.240
Serena...

03:06.090 --> 03:07.720
I'll attempt to channel all I've got into tomorrow!

03:08.180 --> 03:09.510
"Go for broke", right?

03:09.940 --> 03:10.500
Yeah.

03:10.760 --> 03:11.470
Do your best!

03:12.150 --> 03:12.500
I will.

03:19.810 --> 03:25.120
The excitement filling the air at the Glorio Tripokalon Master Class Tournament is extraordinary.

03:33.890 --> 03:34.230
Yeah,

03:34.600 --> 03:35.330
that's perfect!

03:37.010 --> 03:38.130
Hey, Tairenar.

03:41.510 --> 03:43.540
This is the last event, no second chances.

03:45.060 --> 03:47.040
Let's channel all we've got into this.

03:49.130 --> 03:49.800
Let's go.

03:52.970 --> 03:54.310
One, two...

03:55.190 --> 03:56.770
Yeah!

03:57.350 --> 03:59.890
Serena and her Pokémon have perfect teamwork.

04:00.560 --> 04:02.040
We can't fall behind her!

04:02.550 --> 04:03.690
Right, Fushigisou?

04:13.640 --> 04:14.950
Anything you do will be useless.

04:15.350 --> 04:16.910
After all, the one who will become Kalos Queen...

04:17.130 --> 04:18.160
....is me.

04:18.850 --> 04:20.400
We're all set and ready too!

04:42.100 --> 04:44.730
If she wins this, I can return to my normal business.

04:45.350 --> 04:46.920
There are so many people.

04:46.920 --> 04:48.980
It <i>is</i> the Master Class, after all.

04:49.410 --> 04:52.960
This event will determine everything, so the amount of attention it gets is on a whole other level from the other tournaments.

04:54.170 --> 04:55.700
Serena, do your best.

05:01.280 --> 05:03.580
Ladies and gentlemen!

05:05.660 --> 05:06.450
It's been a long wait,

05:07.120 --> 05:09.250
but this moment has finally arrived.

05:10.890 --> 05:14.150
The Glorio Tripokalon Master Class Tournament...

05:16.530 --> 05:18.150
...will now begin!

05:25.140 --> 05:29.040
I'm your guide to your dream of love, Monsieur Pierre.

05:30.310 --> 05:33.120
Now then, let's have them enter the stage right away!

05:36.490 --> 05:39.890
These are the beautiful maidens that have been chosen!

05:41.820 --> 05:42.330
All right,

05:42.960 --> 05:48.810
please take the Princess Keys you've obtained from the fierce fights you've been through so far and insert them in the keyholes with your own hands.

05:49.760 --> 05:52.140
The doors to your future will open.

06:01.890 --> 06:02.980
I searched for myself...

06:03.670 --> 06:05.050
...and stood on the starting line of my dream...

06:06.490 --> 06:07.520
That's what my first Key stands for.

06:16.960 --> 06:17.620
And then,

06:18.710 --> 06:20.500
my dream came closer to turning into reality...

06:21.980 --> 06:23.040
...when I got my second Key.

06:33.050 --> 06:34.170
There have been some mishaps,

06:35.850 --> 06:37.180
but I overcame them together with my Pokémon.

06:38.440 --> 06:39.350
My third Key symbolizes that.

06:46.230 --> 06:47.210
And here...

06:48.150 --> 06:50.180
...I'll become Kalos Queen, no matter what!

07:03.460 --> 07:04.170
Serena!

07:20.120 --> 07:24.240
All right, let me introduce today's special guest!

07:27.720 --> 07:28.180
Who is it?

07:29.250 --> 07:35.170
She is a former Kalos Queen and a legendary manager who has produced numerous Performers:

07:35.440 --> 07:36.780
Yashio-san!

07:37.350 --> 07:40.330
She is attending as a special judge.

07:41.330 --> 07:42.420
Oh, that woman...!

07:43.910 --> 07:47.160
You're lacking something that's absolutely crucial for becoming Queen.

07:47.820 --> 07:51.300
As long as you don't realize what it is, you can't win against Elle.

07:54.920 --> 07:59.590
Today, I'm looking forward to your wonderful performances.

08:00.240 --> 08:01.560
Please do your best.

08:04.600 --> 08:06.850
Yashio-san, thank you very much.

08:07.670 --> 08:08.400
All right:

08:08.850 --> 08:11.350
First off, let's have the Queen make her appearance.

08:11.830 --> 08:14.690
The Kalos Queen, Performer Elle!

08:37.730 --> 08:38.640
Pokémon Quiz.

08:39.190 --> 08:40.060
The answer is...?

08:53.330 --> 08:54.930
She's so popular...

08:55.120 --> 08:56.480
That is the Kalos Queen for you.

08:57.020 --> 09:00.880
So this is what the person Serena has worked so hard in order to defeat is like.

09:01.340 --> 09:02.360
That's awesome.

09:08.570 --> 09:10.120
Hello, everyone!

09:14.850 --> 09:15.460
And...

09:16.130 --> 09:17.240
...hello to all Performers.

09:18.230 --> 09:21.630
We stand on this stage together, and you deserve my profound respect for that.

09:22.480 --> 09:26.650
Let's fight fair and square for the title of Kalos Queen!

09:31.190 --> 09:32.180
Everyone in the audience,

09:32.720 --> 09:34.060
all those of you watching on TV;

09:34.680 --> 09:36.290
please enjoy yourselves to the fullest!

09:38.640 --> 09:40.680
Thank you for the lovely speech, Elle.

09:41.780 --> 09:43.730
Well then, I will now explain the rules.

09:44.170 --> 09:50.490
In the Master Class, there are no more theme performances; you will only be competing in free performances.

09:50.770 --> 09:52.280
Oh, really?

09:52.540 --> 09:52.870
Yes.

09:53.370 --> 10:00.010
Presumably, theme performances serve to test the chemistry and the depth of the bond between Pokémon and Trainer.

10:00.710 --> 10:05.380
Those who have made it this far have already passed that step, I assume.

10:05.850 --> 10:10.720
And the challengers will be fighting in a tournament system!

10:17.180 --> 10:21.070
In the first and second round, they will be using one Pokémon in their performance.

10:21.570 --> 10:25.140
In the semifinals, they will perform with two Pokémon.

10:26.370 --> 10:31.740
The one person to brilliantly win their way through the entire tournament will earn the right to challenge Kalos Queen Elle!

10:32.640 --> 10:35.040
And the winner of <i>that</i> fight will...

10:35.850 --> 10:40.070
...will, along with this tiara, obtain the title of Kalos Queen!

10:45.840 --> 10:46.490
Tairenar,

10:47.200 --> 10:48.440
I'm counting on your for the first match!

10:49.850 --> 10:50.550
After all,

10:51.000 --> 10:52.170
our opponent in the first round is...

10:53.080 --> 10:55.230
A confrontation I wanted to avoid right from the get-go...

10:55.690 --> 10:57.760
The Performers of the first group in the first round...

10:58.640 --> 11:03.000
...are Musavie, Nene and Cal!

11:04.050 --> 11:06.220
First off, each pair gets to perform solo.

11:06.450 --> 11:10.130
Then, at the end, all three pairs will perform simultaneously.

11:10.550 --> 11:12.460
Now then, start!

11:19.230 --> 11:21.110
Pumpjin, Shadow Ball!

11:25.850 --> 11:27.760
All right! All right!

11:33.280 --> 11:34.550
Do your best!

11:39.890 --> 11:42.490
Hey! Wait! Isn't the spotlight supposed to be on me longer!?

11:43.160 --> 11:46.410
We go from Performer Musavie with her mysterious charm...

11:46.410 --> 11:48.780
...to the charming Performer Nene!

11:52.680 --> 11:55.700
Muchul, Heart Stamp!

12:08.660 --> 12:09.900
Good job, Nene!

12:09.900 --> 12:11.180
So cute!

12:12.020 --> 12:14.450
Next up, the cute Performer Cal!

12:14.770 --> 12:16.000
Let's go, Zuruggu!

12:16.380 --> 12:17.330
Focus Blast!

12:20.330 --> 12:21.270
Brick Break!

12:29.740 --> 12:34.340
All right, from here on, three pairs will be showing off their skills at the same time!

12:34.340 --> 12:37.330
Who will win over the most spectators?

12:37.660 --> 12:38.740
Powder Snow!

12:41.340 --> 12:43.160
Zuruggu, Focus Blast!

12:44.200 --> 12:46.680
Watch us.

12:47.360 --> 12:49.300
There's no way a sexy and gorgeous beauty like me...

12:49.780 --> 12:52.790
...will lose to the likes of those lasses.

12:53.360 --> 12:54.920
Shadow Ball!

12:55.290 --> 12:57.810
Full power!

13:06.090 --> 13:07.510
Wh-What's this?

13:15.500 --> 13:16.530
We can't lose!

13:16.820 --> 13:18.150
Zuruggu, do your best!

13:23.530 --> 13:24.690
Finish!

13:25.960 --> 13:27.210
We will now move to the voting.

13:27.990 --> 13:29.230
Members of the audience,

13:29.440 --> 13:35.430
Take the PokéLume at your seat and vote by lighting it in the same color as the Performer you thought was best.

13:36.290 --> 13:39.360
This time it's not just members of the audience that get to vote.

13:39.830 --> 13:42.600
Those of you who're watching on TV are judges as well.

13:43.320 --> 13:45.480
Push the buttons on your smart devices...

13:45.780 --> 13:47.640
...and your vote will enter the ballot.

13:48.380 --> 13:49.950
All right, vote...

13:49.950 --> 13:51.030
S'il-vous-plaît!

13:58.070 --> 13:59.280
Musavie!

14:10.410 --> 14:12.630
The one who advanced to the next glorious stage is...

14:13.080 --> 14:14.550
...Performer Musavie!

14:15.140 --> 14:16.180
Thank you!

14:17.290 --> 14:18.010
That was obvious.

14:18.840 --> 14:19.430
Right?

14:23.610 --> 14:24.280
My time...

14:24.950 --> 14:26.310
...in Master Class...

14:26.720 --> 14:27.800
...is over.

14:28.490 --> 14:29.610
She did it!

14:31.370 --> 14:32.680
So that's what this business is like...

14:35.900 --> 14:36.410
Serena.

14:37.820 --> 14:40.410
No hard feelings, no matter who advances, okay?

14:41.590 --> 14:42.240
Of course not!

14:42.850 --> 14:44.520
Yayakoma, Double Team!

14:46.740 --> 14:48.000
Swift!

14:48.440 --> 14:49.780
Leaf Storm!

14:55.100 --> 14:57.800
All right, we now move on to the fourth group, consisting of...

14:58.100 --> 15:01.120
...Performers Shin Lee, Serena and Millefeui!

15:03.250 --> 15:04.180
It's Serena!

15:04.180 --> 15:05.830
So Millefeui is one of her opponents.

15:05.830 --> 15:07.480
Do your best, Serena!

15:09.500 --> 15:10.900
Go for broke!

15:14.970 --> 15:17.520
All right, start!

15:21.890 --> 15:23.960
Peroream, Cotton Spore!

15:42.170 --> 15:45.180
Millefeui and Peroream's dance is so cute!

15:45.180 --> 15:48.140
Yeah, Peroream's movements have improved even more since we last saw it.

15:51.030 --> 15:52.100
Fairy Wind!

16:03.600 --> 16:04.900
Let's go, Tairenar!

16:05.540 --> 16:06.660
Flamethrower!

16:18.800 --> 16:20.210
Go, go!

16:20.980 --> 16:23.190
Serena and the others seem to be having so much fun!

16:23.190 --> 16:26.220
That's what's most important. Show them your usual self, Serena!

16:28.800 --> 16:30.040
Ice Beam!

16:35.260 --> 16:38.080
Let the show-off time begin!

16:38.900 --> 16:41.060
Peroream, Fairy Wind!

16:42.470 --> 16:44.390
Glacia, Ice Beam!

16:44.980 --> 16:46.920
Tairenar, Fire Blast!

16:58.000 --> 17:00.400
It's now time for the judging.

17:00.400 --> 17:01.540
Are you ready?

17:01.760 --> 17:03.680
All right, s'il-vous-plaît!

17:03.970 --> 17:05.430
Go, Serena!

17:05.590 --> 17:06.770
May it reach!

17:08.280 --> 17:09.490
Serena!

17:14.170 --> 17:16.810
The one who advanced to the next stage is...

17:20.010 --> 17:23.030
...Performer Serena! Congratulations!

17:24.810 --> 17:26.160
We did it, Tairenar!

17:39.030 --> 17:39.840
We're back!

17:42.400 --> 17:45.390
Yancham, Nymphia, it'll be your turn next.

17:47.600 --> 17:48.640
Serena!

17:49.080 --> 17:50.010
Congratulations!

17:50.310 --> 17:51.240
Thank you!

17:51.520 --> 17:53.880
Sana-san, please stand by.

17:53.880 --> 17:54.250
Okay.

17:54.690 --> 17:55.580
All right, I'm off.

17:55.890 --> 17:56.180
Yeah.

17:56.660 --> 17:57.610
Do your best!

18:07.160 --> 18:08.400
Congratulations, Serena.

18:09.690 --> 18:10.160
Millefeui...

18:10.730 --> 18:12.540
Do your best on my behalf too.

18:14.970 --> 18:16.900
Make sure to become Kalos Queen, no matter what!

18:19.030 --> 18:19.630
Yeah...

18:20.290 --> 18:21.430
On my behalf too.

18:25.160 --> 18:26.300
Make sure to win.

18:28.370 --> 18:29.010
I will!

18:29.690 --> 18:30.260
For sure!

18:30.740 --> 18:31.510
For sure!

18:32.690 --> 18:34.740
The one who'll be advancing to the next stage is...

18:35.100 --> 18:36.620
...Performer Sana!

18:58.090 --> 18:59.900
Let's have them come onto the stage:

19:00.370 --> 19:05.830
These are the beautiful and wonderful maidens who have made it to the semifinals!

19:10.010 --> 19:11.970
Oh no... My heart won't stop pounding.

19:12.570 --> 19:13.860
After all, this is the decisive moment.

19:14.220 --> 19:15.520
Let us believe in Serena.

19:17.820 --> 19:19.480
Go, go, Musavie!

19:19.800 --> 19:21.360
Performer Musavie,

19:22.040 --> 19:23.370
Performer Sana...

19:24.000 --> 19:25.580
...or Performer Serena?

19:26.160 --> 19:29.320
Now, which maiden will win?

19:30.310 --> 19:31.620
Full power, Serena.

19:32.970 --> 19:33.480
Of course!

19:35.190 --> 19:37.970
Hey, I want to see one of those Tripokalons, too.

19:38.500 --> 19:41.880
I'd really like to see what Pokémon Performers do!

19:42.330 --> 19:43.520
Let's go together, then!

19:44.240 --> 19:44.540
Yeah!

19:45.620 --> 19:47.050
Thank you, Sana.

19:47.460 --> 19:47.700
Huh?

19:48.390 --> 19:50.060
If you hadn't invited me back then...

19:50.480 --> 19:50.950
I'd be...

19:53.340 --> 19:55.060
It's not over yet, Serena.

19:55.510 --> 19:55.810
Yeah.

19:56.360 --> 19:58.230
Let's not leave any regrets.

20:02.150 --> 20:07.610
Serena and Sana have advanced to the semifinals of the Tripokalon Master Class.

20:08.630 --> 20:13.210
The finale of these beautiful and fierce performance battles will be shown in the next episode.

20:15.990 --> 20:20.960
Sunday March 20th at 8am!

20:15.990 --> 20:20.960
Tonikaku Akarui

20:15.990 --> 20:20.960
Yasumura

20:15.990 --> 20:20.960
Abareru-kun

20:16.570 --> 20:17.980
Don't worry.

20:19.350 --> 20:20.650
We're not wearing anything!

20:20.990 --> 20:29.010
Professor Okido

20:21.350 --> 20:23.490
The latest Pokémon movie news!

20:24.030 --> 20:28.550
Incredible! The special pre-order ticket for the movie will go on sale April 16th!

20:29.970 --> 20:31.560
The special pre-order ticket comes with...

20:31.560 --> 20:36.210
...a present code that will allow you to obtain the mythical Pokémon Volcanion in your game!

20:37.910 --> 20:41.160
The moves this Volcanion knows are super-exquisite!

20:42.130 --> 20:45.500
One of the most powerful Fire type moves, Overheat,

20:46.140 --> 20:49.320
one of the most powerful Water type moves, Hydro Pump...

20:50.390 --> 20:53.220
...and Mist, a move that can be used to turn the battle in your favor.

20:55.000 --> 21:00.000
It also has a move that only Volcanion, who possesses both the Fire and the Water type, can learn:

21:00.590 --> 21:02.200
Steam Eruption!

21:03.100 --> 21:08.300
After attacking with hot steam, there's an additional chance that the opponent gets burned.

21:09.320 --> 21:12.380
No doubt you're excited for the special pre-order ticket and the present code that comes with it!

21:12.700 --> 21:14.920
For more info, check out our homepage!

21:18.220 --> 21:20.150
All right, everyone! Let's go together!

21:20.340 --> 21:21.430
Towards our next adventure!

21:22.820 --> 21:25.280
This is the climax of the Tripokalon Master Class!

21:25.830 --> 21:30.210
I'll make sure to make it to the finals and stand on the same stage as Elle-san!

21:31.080 --> 21:33.320
That's right! I won't give up till the end!

21:34.260 --> 21:37.040
Next time on Pocket Monsters XY&Z:

21:37.690 --> 21:41.000
Elle VS Serena! Open the Door to the Future!!

21:41.640 --> 21:44.450
We'll move forward! We'll chase after a new "love"

21:42.420 --> 21:45.920
Next Time

21:42.420 --> 21:45.920
Elle VS Serena!
Open the Door to the Future!!

21:45.950 --> 21:55.980
Next episode:

21:45.950 --> 21:50.910
Serena finally reaches the semifinals!

21:46.890 --> 21:51.460
Pocket Monsters XY&Z was brought to you by these sponsors.

21:50.940 --> 21:55.980
Who will obtain the laurels of victory...?
